# 🗿 Giant System

## 🗿 Giant Role

The Giant is not simply a large enemy. The Giant can function as part of the level itself.

## ⚡ Giant Abilities

The Giant will have unique powers that are different from Tiny Players.

## 🪤 Giant Obstacles

The Giant can place obstacles/traps along routes used by Tiny Players. The exact obstacle list is not finalized yet.

## 🎯 Design Goal

Giant abilities should create interesting decisions and route changes without making Tiny Players feel helpless.

## ⏳ Open Decisions

- 🏆 Exact Giant objective
- ⚡ Final Giant powers
- 🪤 Final obstacle/trap system
- 💰 How the Giant earns or spends resources
- ⚖️ Balance between Giant power and Tiny Player counterplay
